  "description": "Conformance kit for Unified.Data.Tables stores: named, framework-neutral scenarios that hold any IStorage<T> or IPolymorphicStorage<TBase> (a provider, a decorator, a hand-written fake) to the contract every provider of the library keeps, in five tiers (logical, failures, capabilities, polymorphic, large values). Describe the store with a small factory, run the scenarios from any test framework, and read per-scenario results; a fake that is not there yet declares named leniencies and is reported instead of failed. Ships two decorators for tests: CountingStorage<T> and FaultInjectingStorage<T> (transient failures and lost responses). References the abstractions only, no test framework.",
